Identify scrolls are the most common (other than blank scrolls?), and
the cheapest.  If you can buy a scroll for <50 gold, it's ID.  If you
get a zillion scrolls, and have lots more of one kind, it's probably
ID as well.  Or you could hope for a spellbook of ID and use it to
ID your scrolls, since all spells are useful (or at least non-harmful),
and at high levels, you'll almost never fail.  Or you could wish for
some scrolls of ID and use those to ID the rest.  But really, there
isn't much problem reading unidentified scrolls, if you're careful.
Sure, you'll get messed up sometimes, but it makes the game much more
playable.  What've you got to worry about?  Fire, amnesia, destroy
armor, what else?  Assuming you aren't reading cursed scrolls, anyway.

